('venue-blue-mountains-botanic-garden-mount-tomah', 'blue-mountains-botanic-garden-mount-tomah', 'Blue Mountains Botanic Garden Mount Tomah', 'Venue', 'Mount Tomah, Blue Mountains NSW', 'Bells Line of Road, Mount Tomah NSW 2758', 'https://www.botanicgardens.org.au/venues-and-lawns/all-venues-and-lawns/waratah-room', '+61 2 9231 8111', NULL, 'https://www.botanicgardens.org.au/venues-and-lawns/all-venues-and-lawns/waratah-room', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'Waratah Room seats 60; the Signature Botanic Wedding Package allows up to 100 standing. The Formal Garden page says up to 120 for hire while its package text says 100 standing or 60 seated, so the lower figures are stored. Viewing Deck package is up to 50; Camellia Garden and DeFerranti Pavilion up to 30. Price (operator site, verify before booking): 2026-27 official rates: Signature Botanic Wedding Package $4,700 (3 hour ceremony, 5 hour reception in the Waratah Room); Blooms, Views and Vows Package $4,900 (observation platform and Visitor Centre, 5 hours from 4pm, up to 50); Formal Garden ceremony $2,100 for 3 hours; Camellia Garden $600 for 1.5 hours; bond $500; extra hours $430. Wedding photography permit $315 unless included in a package.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["botanical"], "special_subtype": ["botanic garden", "cool-climate garden", "mountain lookout", "rooftop garden"], "sources": ["https://www.botanicgardens.org.au/venues-and-lawns/all-venues-and-lawns/waratah-room", "http://www.botanicgardens.org.au/venues-and-lawns/all-venues-and-lawns/formal-garden", "https://www.botanicgardens.org.au/venues-and-lawns/all-venues-and-lawns/viewing-deck-and-visitor-centre", "https://www.botanicgardens.org.au/venues-and-lawns/all-venues-and-lawns/camellia-garden-and-deferranti-pavilion", "https://www.botanicgardens.org.au/mount-tomah"], "flags": ["email_missing_form_only", "capacity_conflict", "permit_required", "limited_wheelchair_access"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking']),
('venue-chinese-garden-of-friendship-darling-harbour', 'chinese-garden-of-friendship-darling-harbour', 'Chinese Garden of Friendship Darling Harbour', 'Venue', 'Darling Harbour, Sydney NSW', 'Pier St, cnr Harbour St, Darling Harbour NSW 2000', 'https://www.darlingharbour.com/precincts/chinese-garden/weddings,-functions,-filming-and-photography-at-th', '02 9240 8888', 'functions@property.nsw.gov.au', 'https://www.darlingharbour.com/precincts/chinese-garden/weddings,-functions,-filming-and-photography-at-th', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'Whole-garden evening function: 100 seated, 180 cocktail. Daytime ceremony pavilions are smaller: Peace Boat Pavilion 30 standing/12 seated, Water Pavilion 50/48, Hall of Longevity 100/48, counting all attendees including celebrant and photographers. Price (operator site, verify before booking): 2026 sheets: ceremony pavilion hire 3 hours $780 (Peace Boat), $980 (Water), $1,280 (Hall of Longevity), GST incl, $280 holding deposit. Exclusive evening hire of the lower garden $6,000 (5.30pm to midnight, $1,500 deposit), extra hours $1,200. Furniture in pavilions included free.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["botanical"], "special_subtype": ["chinese garden", "pavilions", "public garden"], "sources": ["https://www.darlingharbour.com/precincts/chinese-garden/weddings,-functions,-filming-and-photography-at-th", "https://www.darlingharbour.com/getmedia/087dc737-2d09-4ddb-8666-70f5ac52465d/wedding-ceremony-2026.pdf", "https://www.darlingharbour.com/getmedia/37e70e6d-0097-47b1-a4d8-f5c78163e964/venue-hire-2026.pdf", "https://www.darlingharbour.com/getmedia/1ea42305-d979-49fd-9618-6293715475df/evening-functions-2026.pdf"], "flags": ["postcode_inferred", "exclusive_caterer", "verify_external_caterers_allowed", "pedestrian_access_only", "alcohol_and_music_cease_1030pm_evening"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking']),
('venue-wollongong-botanic-garden', 'wollongong-botanic-garden', 'Wollongong Botanic Garden', 'Venue', 'Keiraville, Illawarra NSW', 'Murphys Avenue, Keiraville NSW 2500', 'https://wollongongbotanicgarden.com.au/events/weddings', '02 4227 7667', 'botanicgarden@wollongong.nsw.gov.au', 'https://wollongongbotanicgarden.com.au/events/weddings', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'Rose Garden ceremony page states up to 150 guests; capacities for other ceremony spaces (Arid Collection, Temple Garden, Turpentine Lawn, Woodland Garden and Meadow) were not read. Ceremonies only; no reception option seen. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Official fees page (2026-27, GST incl): exclusive use of a garden collection section for weddings $735 per hour, Rose Garden function package (30 white chairs, signing table, cloth) $218, refundable bond $485. Ceremony bookings include one hour setup and one hour pack-down at no charge. Entry is free.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["botanical"], "special_subtype": ["botanic garden", "rose garden", "glasshouse", "ceremony lawns"], "sources": ["https://wollongongbotanicgarden.com.au/events/weddings", "https://wollongongbotanicgarden.com.au/events/weddings/rose-garden", "https://wollongongbotanicgarden.com.au/events/fees-and-charges", "https://wollongongbotanicgarden.com.au/visit/hours-and-location"], "flags": ["ceremony_only", "postcode_inferred", "no_alcohol_on_site", "rose_garden_closed_july_to_september"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking']),
('venue-hunter-region-botanic-gardens', 'hunter-region-botanic-gardens', 'Hunter Region Botanic Gardens', 'Venue', 'Heatherbrae, Hunter NSW', '2100 Pacific Highway, Heatherbrae NSW 2324', 'https://www.huntergardens.org.au/weddings/', '(02) 4987 1655', 'events@huntergardens.org.au', 'https://www.huntergardens.org.au/weddings/', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'Capacities per ceremony spot are not stated on the official pages. The site structured data lists a different phone (02 4987 1140); the wedding page number is stored. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Not published; wedding packages are under review and the events team quotes current prices, including new elopement packages. Bookings are essential and fees apply.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["botanical"], "special_subtype": ["botanic garden", "bush chapel", "rotunda", "lily pond"], "sources": ["https://www.huntergardens.org.au/weddings/", "https://www.huntergardens.org.au/?p=600", "https://www.huntergardens.org.au/"], "flags": ["capacity_unknown", "price_not_published", "phone_conflict_verify"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking']),
('venue-auburn-botanic-gardens', 'auburn-botanic-gardens', 'Auburn Botanic Gardens', 'Venue', 'Auburn, Western Sydney NSW', '99 Chiswick Road, Auburn NSW 2144', 'https://www.cumberland.nsw.gov.au/auburn-botanic-gardens', '(02) 8757 9000', 'council@cumberland.nsw.gov.au', 'https://www.cumberland.nsw.gov.au/auburn-botanic-gardens', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'No capacity stated in the council pages or FAQ. Minimum booking is 1.5 hours with a 30 minute gap between events; tables and chairs must be hired in and set on paved surfaces. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Not published on the pages read; fees and bond are quoted in the council''s online booking system. Extra non-resident entry charges may apply if more guests attend than booked.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["botanical"], "special_subtype": ["botanic garden", "japanese garden", "scented garden", "rose garden"], "sources": ["https://www.cumberland.nsw.gov.au/auburn-botanic-gardens", "https://www.cumberland.nsw.gov.au/sites/default/files/inline-files/auburn-botanic-gardens-faqs.pdf"], "flags": ["ceremony_only", "postcode_inferred", "price_not_published", "exclusive_use_not_guaranteed", "no_marquees", "no_food_on_site", "email_is_general_council"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking']),
('venue-fagan-park-galston', 'fagan-park-galston', 'Fagan Park Galston', 'Venue', 'Galston, Hills District NSW', '38-48 Arcadia Road, Galston NSW 2159', 'https://www.hornsby.nsw.gov.au/faganpark', '(02) 9847 6666', 'hsc@hornsby.nsw.gov.au', 'https://www.hornsby.nsw.gov.au/faganpark', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'No ceremony capacity stated. Bookings are for a two-hour block, ceremony only, 9am to 3.30pm weekdays and 10am to 3.30pm weekends; marquees are not allowed. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Not read; the council links a Fagan Park fees and charges PDF that could not be opened.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["botanical"], "special_subtype": ["themed gardens", "public garden", "lake gardens"], "sources": ["https://www.hornsby.nsw.gov.au/faganpark"], "flags": ["ceremony_only", "price_not_read", "no_marquees", "email_is_general_council", "no_reception"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking']),
