('venue-campbell-rhododendron-gardens', 'campbell-rhododendron-gardens', 'Campbell Rhododendron Gardens', 'Venue', 'Blackheath, Blue Mountains NSW', 'Bacchante St, Blackheath NSW 2785', 'https://www.rhodogarden.org.au/booking-information', '+61 2 4787 8965', NULL, 'https://www.rhodogarden.org.au/hire', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'Ceremonies are priced in two bands, up to 50 guests and up to 100 guests; 100 is the maximum. The sealed car park holds about 40 cars. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Total booking fee $300 for up to 50 guests or $500 for up to 100 guests; 50% deposit to secure the date and the balance one month before. Cancellation more than 30 days out refunds the deposit less a $55 fee.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["botanical"], "special_subtype": ["rhododendron garden", "volunteer-run garden", "ceremony sites"], "sources": ["https://www.rhodogarden.org.au/hire", "https://www.rhodogarden.org.au/booking-information", "https://www.rhodogarden.org.au/wedding-faq"], "flags": ["ceremony_only", "email_missing_form_only", "postcode_inferred", "catering_alcohol_rules_unknown", "no_sheltered_site_reported", "voicemail_phone"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking']),
