('venue-taronga-western-plains-zoo', 'taronga-western-plains-zoo', 'Taronga Western Plains Zoo', 'Venue', 'Dubbo, Central West NSW', 'Obley Road, Dubbo, NSW 2830', 'https://www.taronga.org.au/dubbo-zoo/function-venue-hire/weddings/', '(02) 6881 1438', 'savannahfc@zoo.nsw.gov.au', 'https://www.taronga.org.au/dubbo-zoo/function-venue-hire/weddings/', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'Seating capacity of the Savannah Function Centre is not stated. Reception and ceremony-and-reception packages require a minimum of 50 guests; the Elope at the Zoo package is limited to 25 guests. The ceremony setup includes 50 chairs. Price (operator site, verify before booking): From the official September 2024 package PDF: reception only $1,500 hire; ceremony and reception $2,500 hire; Elope at the Zoo $3,000 (3 hours, max 25 guests); photography session $750. Catering two courses $99 pp, three courses $119 pp, canapes $28 pp, grazing board $15 pp, kids menu $35 per child under 12. Prices may have changed since.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["zoo_aquarium"], "special_subtype": ["zoo"], "sources": ["https://www.taronga.org.au/dubbo-zoo/function-venue-hire/weddings/", "https://taronga.org.au/western-plains-zoo/function-venue-hire/weddings", "https://www.taronga.org.au/siteassets/tzwp/files/twpz-wedding-package-2-compressed.pdf"], "flags": ["postcode_inferred", "capacity_not_published", "price_from_sept_2024_pdf"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking']),
('venue-featherdale-wildlife-park', 'featherdale-wildlife-park', 'Featherdale Wildlife Park', 'Venue', 'Doonside, Western Sydney NSW', '217 Kildare Road, Doonside, NSW 2767', 'https://www.featherdale.com.au/events/', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.featherdale.com.au/', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'The Drover''s Hut seats 90 inside or outside and takes 110 grazing style. Keeper''s Courtyard seats up to 60 at picnic tables; two picnic areas seat 50 each. Events are daytime only and only acoustic music is allowed in the Drover''s Hut. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Not published on the page; Exclusive Hire and Group Packages PDFs are linked but were not read.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["zoo_aquarium"], "special_subtype": ["wildlife park"], "sources": ["https://www.featherdale.com.au/", "https://www.featherdale.com.au/events/"], "flags": ["verify_weddings_accepted", "needs_contact_lookup", "email_missing_form_only", "prices_not_published"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking', 'needs_contact_lookup']),
('venue-mogo-wildlife-park', 'mogo-wildlife-park', 'Mogo Wildlife Park', 'Venue', 'Mogo, South Coast NSW', '222 Tomakin Road, Mogo, NSW 2536', 'https://mogowildlifepark.com.au/events/', NULL, NULL, 'https://mogowildlifepark.com.au/', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'Function and Events Centre (by Primate Island): 100 seated indoors or cocktail style; up to 300 using the outdoor verandahs and picnic areas. Grassy Glade up to 200 with marquees/tables (weather dependent). Main Cafe terrace 50 seated or about 100 standing; Tiger Deck 50. Whole-park exclusive hire is available. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Not published on the events page; Event Day Packages (Exclusive Hire) and Group Packages PDFs are linked but were not read.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["zoo_aquarium"], "special_subtype": ["zoo"], "sources": ["https://mogowildlifepark.com.au/", "https://mogowildlifepark.com.au/events/"], "flags": ["verify_weddings_accepted", "needs_contact_lookup", "email_missing_form_only", "prices_not_published"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking', 'needs_contact_lookup']),
('venue-james-theatre-dungog', 'james-theatre-dungog', 'James Theatre Dungog', 'Venue', 'Dungog, Hunter Region NSW', '6 Brown Street, Dungog NSW 2420', 'https://www.jamestheatre.com.au/hire', NULL, 'contact@jamestheatre.com.au', 'https://www.jamestheatre.com.au/hire', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'Capacity is not published. The hire page describes a divisible auditorium, two cinema screens, a tiered cinema seating area, a large dance floor, movable tables and chairs, a stage, a kiosk and a food preparation area. Floor plans are in the site photo gallery. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Hirings start at $55 (incl GST) per two hours for a small not-for-profit meeting; tables $11 and chairs $1.65 each (incl GST). Wedding hire pricing is not published.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["entertainment"], "special_subtype": ["historic cinema", "community theatre", "function hall"], "sources": ["https://www.jamestheatre.com.au/hire", "https://www.jamestheatre.com.au/about", "https://www.jamestheatre.com.au/contact"], "flags": ["outside_sydney", "phone_not_published", "capacity_not_published", "wedding_price_not_published", "email_from_about_page_button", "needs_contact_lookup"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking', 'needs_contact_lookup']),
('venue-the-roxy-theatre-bingara', 'the-roxy-theatre-bingara', 'The Roxy Theatre Bingara', 'Venue', 'Bingara, Gwydir Shire, North West Slopes NSW', '74 Maitland Street, Bingara NSW 2404', 'https://visitgwydir.com.au/the-roxy-theatre/', '(02) 6724 0066', 'btourism@gwydir.nsw.gov.au', 'https://visitgwydir.com.au/the-roxy-theatre/', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'No capacity figures on the official page. Contact is the Bingara Visitor Information Centre, which handles bookings. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Hire prices not published. The page lists only theatre and Greek Cafe Museum tours at $10 per person (two people minimum).', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["entertainment"], "special_subtype": ["historic cinema", "art deco theatre", "function centre"], "sources": ["https://visitgwydir.com.au/the-roxy-theatre/", "https://www.roxybingara.com.au/functions/"], "flags": ["outside_sydney", "generic_wedding_statement_only", "capacity_not_published", "price_not_published", "email_is_visitor_centre_general", "needs_contact_lookup", "verify_weddings_accepted"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking', 'needs_contact_lookup']),
('venue-kingpin-north-strathfield-room-300', 'kingpin-north-strathfield-room-300', 'Kingpin North Strathfield (Room 300)', 'Venue', 'North Strathfield, Inner West NSW', '3-5 George St, North Strathfield NSW 2137', 'https://www.kingpinbowling.com.au/venues/nsw/north-strathfield', '(02) 4063 1514', NULL, 'https://www.kingpinbowling.com.au/venues/nsw/north-strathfield', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'Official page states Room 300 has a 60 person capacity with 3 private bowling lanes and a private karaoke room; it does not say whether that is seated or standing, so both fields are left null. The wider venue has 16 lanes, laser tag, darts, a pool table and arcade games. Room 300 availability is by enquiry. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Not published on the official site; hire is by enquiry form or phone. Third-party listings quote minimum spends but those are not used here.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["entertainment"], "special_subtype": ["bowling alley", "arcade"], "sources": ["https://www.kingpinbowling.com.au/venues/nsw/north-strathfield", "https://kingpinbowling.com.au/parties-and-events/corporate-parties", "https://www.kingpinplay.com/en-au/parties-and-events/group-events/"], "flags": ["verify_weddings_accepted", "email_missing_form_only", "capacity_type_unspecified", "price_not_published", "other_kingpin_nsw_sites_not_checked"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking']),
('venue-archie-brothers-cirque-electriq-alexandria', 'archie-brothers-cirque-electriq-alexandria', 'Archie Brothers Cirque Electriq Alexandria', 'Venue', 'Alexandria, Inner South NSW', '75 O''Riordan Street, Alexandria NSW 2015', 'https://www.archiebrothers.com.au/parties/exclusive-hire', '1300 888 386', NULL, 'https://www.archiebrothers.com.au/parties/exclusive-hire', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'Capacity is not stated on the official exclusive-hire or Alexandria pages. Exclusive hire covers the whole venue: arcade and carnival games, bowling, bumper cars, a cocktail bar and kitchen. Other NSW Archie Brothers sites (Chatswood, Castle Towers, Entertainment Quarter, Penrith, Wollongong) use the same enquiry process and are not recorded separately. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Not published; booking is by online form, enquiry or phone.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["entertainment"], "special_subtype": ["arcade bar", "bowling alley"], "sources": ["https://www.archiebrothers.com.au/parties/exclusive-hire", "https://www.archiebrothers.com.au/locations/alexandria", "https://www.archiebrothers.com.au/"], "flags": ["verify_weddings_accepted", "email_missing_form_only", "capacity_not_published", "price_not_published", "address_map_link_shows_55_doody_st", "other_nsw_sites_not_recorded"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking']),
('venue-fortress-sydney', 'fortress-sydney', 'Fortress Sydney', 'Venue', 'Chippendale, Inner Sydney NSW', 'Level 2, 28 Broadway, Chippendale NSW 2008', 'https://fortress.games/functions', '(02) 8609 3336', 'hi@fortress.games', 'https://fortress.games/functions', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'Official function-spaces table for Sydney: Arena cocktail 360, banquet 100, theatre 156, cabaret 70; Tavern semi-exclusive 70, full restaurant seated and standing 380; 2315 Bar (Sydney only, retro arcades and LED pool table) 70 cocktail. The functions page also says groups of 10 to 1,000 are hosted across the two cities, which exceeds the Sydney room figures, so the lower per-room Arena figures are stored. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Official functions page says packages start from $43 per person; no room hire or minimum spend figures are published.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["entertainment"], "special_subtype": ["arcade bar", "gaming tavern"], "sources": ["https://fortress.games/functions", "https://fortress.games/locations"], "flags": ["verify_weddings_accepted", "capacity_figures_vary_by_space", "minimum_spend_not_published", "arcade_only_in_2315_bar_in_sydney"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking']),
('venue-astros-arcade-bar', 'astros-arcade-bar', 'Astro''s Arcade Bar', 'Venue', 'Newtown, Inner West NSW', '22 King St, Newtown NSW 2042', 'https://www.astrosarcadebar.com/venue-hire', NULL, 'info@astros-co.com', 'https://www.astrosarcadebar.com/', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'No capacity figures are published; the venue-hire form simply asks for an approximate guest count and a preferred date. The venue trades Tuesday to Sunday with Sunday opening 1pm to 7pm. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Not published; enquiry form only.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["entertainment"], "special_subtype": ["arcade bar"], "sources": ["https://www.astrosarcadebar.com/", "https://www.astrosarcadebar.com/venue-hire"], "flags": ["verify_weddings_accepted", "needs_contact_lookup", "weddings_nav_link_dead", "capacity_not_published", "price_not_published", "website_footer_copyright_2024"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking', 'needs_contact_lookup']),
