('venue-holey-moley-golf-club-sydney', 'holey-moley-golf-club-sydney', 'Holey Moley Golf Club Sydney', 'Venue', 'Darlinghurst, Inner Sydney NSW', 'Lot 1&2, 82-94 Darlinghurst Road, Potts Point NSW 2011', 'https://holeymoley.com.au/parties/exclusive-hire', '1300 727 833', NULL, 'https://holeymoley.com.au/parties/exclusive-hire', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'No capacity figures published on the exclusive hire page or the Darlinghurst location page. Exclusive hire gives the whole venue (two mini golf courses, bar, other on-site activities) to one group. The Alexandria site (75 O''Riordan Street, Alexandria NSW 2015) takes exclusive hire through the same page and phone line and is covered by this record. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Not published. Enquiry form or phone only. Standard public pricing (e.g. 18 holes $42 Thu-Sun) is not an exclusive hire price.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["entertainment"], "special_subtype": ["mini golf", "cocktail bar", "karaoke", "arcade"], "sources": ["https://holeymoley.com.au/parties/exclusive-hire", "https://holeymoley.com.au/locations/darlinghurst"], "flags": ["needs_contact_lookup", "email_missing_form_only", "capacity_not_published", "price_not_published", "multi_site_single_record", "address_listed_as_darlinghurst_but_postcode_potts_point"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking', 'needs_contact_lookup']),
