('venue-strike-bowling-king-street-wharf', 'strike-bowling-king-street-wharf', 'Strike Bowling King Street Wharf', 'Venue', 'Darling Harbour, Sydney CBD NSW', '22 The Promenade, King Street Wharf, Darling Harbour, Sydney NSW 2000', 'https://strikebowling.com.au/parties/exclusive-hire', NULL, NULL, 'https://strikebowling.com.au/parties/exclusive-hire', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'The Darling Harbour location page says the venue seats up to 80 people including front bar tables and the outdoor area. The exclusive-hire page says each venue differs in size and that maximum capacity is shown during booking, so standing capacity is not published. Other NSW Strike sites on the same exclusive-hire programme: Macquarie Centre, 4 Waterloo Rd, North Ryde NSW 2113; Mandarin Centre, Level 4/65 Albert Ave, Chatswood NSW 2067; Alexandria; Entertainment Quarter (207/122 Lang Rd, Sydney NSW 2021); Castle Hill; Penrith; Charlestown; Wollongong. They share one enquiry form and have no separate contact details, so they are covered by this single record. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Not published; exclusive hire is quoted through the enquiry form and the concierge team.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["entertainment"], "special_subtype": ["bowling alley", "arcade bar"], "sources": ["https://strikebowling.com.au/parties/exclusive-hire", "https://strikebowling.com.au/parties/how-to-book", "https://strikebowling.com.au/locations/strike-darling-harbour"], "flags": ["verify_weddings_accepted", "needs_contact_lookup", "email_missing_form_only", "multi_site_single_record", "price_not_published", "standing_capacity_not_published"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking', 'needs_contact_lookup']),
