('venue-3danks', '3danks', '3Danks', 'Venue', 'Waterloo, Sydney NSW', '3 Danks Street, Waterloo NSW 2017', 'https://www.3danks.com.au/weddings', '(02) 5022 1109', 'hello@3danks.com.au', 'https://www.3danks.com.au/weddings', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', '2026-11-05', 'active', 'Whole venue: 270 seated dinner, 400 standing cocktail, 342 theatre-style ceremony seats. Amplified music ends 9:30pm; bump-out can continue later. Price (operator site, verify before booking): Full-venue hire from $3,300 + GST with a $500-$1,000 bond; dance-floor flooring in The Gantry is $500 + GST extra. No wedding package; you choose your own caterer, celebrant, florist and styling.', '{"source": "unconventional_venues_import", "imported": "2026-11-05", "special_category": ["warehouse"], "special_subtype": ["industrial warehouse", "blank canvas"], "sources": ["https://www.3danks.com.au/weddings", "https://www.3danks.com.au/info"], "flags": ["dry_hire_blank_canvas"]}'::jsonb, ARRAY['unconventional-import', 'verify-before-booking']),
