('venue-auburn-botanic-gardens', 'editorial_summary', '"A council botanic garden with themed sections such as a Japanese garden, scented garden and sunken rose garden that couples can book for ceremonies and photos. Receptions, marquees and food are not allowed on site, so a separate reception venue is needed."'::jsonb, 'known', 0.8, 'primary_official', 'https://www.cumberland.nsw.gov.au/auburn-botanic-gardens', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-11-05 00:00:00+00', NULL),
