('venue-fagan-park-galston', 'editorial_summary', '"A council park made up of themed gardens, among them Japanese, Dutch, English and Mediterranean sections beside a lake, that can be booked for outdoor ceremonies. Receptions and parties are not available, so the day would need a separate venue after the vows."'::jsonb, 'known', 0.8, 'primary_official', 'https://www.hornsby.nsw.gov.au/faganpark', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-11-05 00:00:00+00', NULL),
