('venue-lisgar-gardens-hornsby', 'editorial_summary', '"A small council garden with a pavilion and formal lawn that Hornsby Shire takes bookings for weddings and photos. It suits a short ceremony only, since parties and catering are ruled out."'::jsonb, 'known', 0.8, 'primary_official', 'https://www.hornsby.nsw.gov.au/lifestyle/sports-and-recreation/parks-and-playgrounds/lisgar-gardens', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-11-05 00:00:00+00', NULL),
