('venue-everglades-house-and-gardens', 'editorial_summary', '"A heritage English-style garden run by the National Trust in the Blue Mountains, available for wedding ceremonies in daytime hours. The official page says receptions and accommodation are not offered, so it works as a ceremony location paired with a separate reception."'::jsonb, 'known', 0.8, 'primary_official', 'https://www.nationaltrust.org.au/places/everglades-house-gardens/venue-hire/', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-11-05 00:00:00+00', NULL),
