('venue-campbell-rhododendron-gardens', 'editorial_summary', '"A volunteer-run rhododendron garden near Blackheath that reserves a chosen site for a wedding ceremony while staying open to the public. Fees are set by guest band and gates close early in cooler months, so timing needs planning."'::jsonb, 'known', 0.8, 'primary_official', 'https://www.rhodogarden.org.au/hire', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-11-05 00:00:00+00', NULL),
