('venue-gosford-edogawa-commemorative-garden', 'editorial_summary', '"A Japanese garden beside Gosford Regional Gallery where weddings are usually held in the Koi Pavilion. Public access continues during opening hours, bookings are short, and the on-site cafe is the named caterer for functions."'::jsonb, 'known', 0.8, 'primary_official', 'https://www.centralcoast.nsw.gov.au/recreation/planning-events/weddings', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-11-05 00:00:00+00', NULL),
