('venue-kingpin-north-strathfield-room-300', 'editorial_summary', '"A converted 1908 biscuit-factory building in Sydney''s inner west with a private function room that has its own bowling lanes and karaoke. Weddings are not named anywhere on the official pages, so it reads more as a playful engagement, rehearsal-dinner or casual reception space for a small guest list. Enquiries go through the venue''s events team."'::jsonb, 'known', 0.8, 'primary_official', 'https://www.kingpinbowling.com.au/venues/nsw/north-strathfield', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-11-05 00:00:00+00', NULL),
