('venue-archie-brothers-cirque-electriq-alexandria', 'editorial_summary', '"A circus-themed arcade, bowling and cocktail venue that can be booked out entirely, giving a group private access to the games and the bar. The official copy mentions corporate, Christmas, birthday, hen and buck events but not weddings, so any wedding use needs to be raised with the venue directly. It would suit a high-energy after-party or casual celebration rather than a formal ceremony."'::jsonb, 'known', 0.8, 'primary_official', 'https://www.archiebrothers.com.au/parties/exclusive-hire', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-11-05 00:00:00+00', NULL),
