('venue-fortress-sydney', 'editorial_summary', '"A medieval-tavern games venue in Central Park with an esports arena, a themed restaurant and bar, and a neon upstairs cocktail room with retro arcade machines that can be hired privately. The events team offers food and drink packages and AV support, and the listed use cases are corporate, party and social events with no mention of weddings. Worth considering for a geeky, fantasy-leaning reception once the venue confirms it takes weddings."'::jsonb, 'known', 0.8, 'primary_official', 'https://fortress.games/functions', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-11-05 00:00:00+00', NULL),
