('venue-astros-arcade-bar', 'editorial_summary', '"A retro arcade bar on King Street in Newtown with local beer, trivia and comedy nights, and a venue-hire enquiry form for private events. The site''s navigation includes a Weddings tab, but it points to an expired external website, so there is no wedding information to rely on. Treat it as a quirky small-scale option and ask directly whether a wedding or reception is possible."'::jsonb, 'known', 0.8, 'primary_official', 'https://www.astrosarcadebar.com/', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-11-05 00:00:00+00', NULL),
