('venue-arcade-bar-and-club', 'editorial_summary', '"A heritage-building bar and club in the CBD that is now positioned as a refined New York-inspired dining and nightlife space with three connectable rooms, premium add-ons such as photobooths and ceiling projections, and tailored food and drink packages. The current official site does not mention arcade games or weddings; its listed event types are birthdays, Christmas, end of financial year and brand events. Include only as a possible stylish after-party or reception space pending confirmation of weddings and the arcade element."'::jsonb, 'known', 0.8, 'primary_official', 'https://arcadesydney.com.au/', 'Unconventional venues import 2026-11-05', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-11-05 00:00:00+00', NULL),
